{'symbol': 'MAR', 'date': '2023-02-14 07:00:00', 'title': 'MARRIOTT INTERNATIONAL REPORTS FOURTH QUARTER AND FULL YEAR 2022 RESULTS', 'text': 'FOURTH QUARTER 2022 COMPARABLE SYSTEMWIDE CONSTANT DOLLAR REVPAR INCREASED 28.8 PERCENT WORLDWIDE, 23.6 PERCENT IN THE U.S. & CANADA, AND 45.1 PERCENT IN INTERNATIONAL MARKETS, COMPARED TO THE 2021 FOURTH QUARTER;\xa0 FOURTH QUARTER 2022 COMPARABLE SYSTEMWIDE CONSTANT DOLLAR REVPAR INCREASED 4.6 PERCENT WORLDWIDE, 5.2 PERCENT IN THE U.S. & CANADA, AND 3.4 PERCENT IN INTERNATIONAL MARKETS, COMPARED TO THE 2019 FOURTH QUARTER;\xa0 FOURTH QUARTER REPORTED DILUTED EPS TOTALED $2.12, COMPARED TO REPORTED DILUTED EPS OF $1.42 IN THE YEAR-AGO QUARTER.\xa0 FOURTH QUARTER ADJUSTED DILUTED EPS TOTALED $1.96, COMPARED TO FOURTH QUARTER 2021 ADJUSTED DILUTED EPS OF $1.30; FOURTH QUARTER REPORTED NET INCOME TOTALED $673 MILLION, COMPARED TO REPORTED NET INCOME OF $468 MILLION IN THE YEAR-AGO QUARTER.'}